        "content": "<p>rvolosatovs opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14667\">PR #14667</a> from <code>rvolosatovs:fix/http-p2-error-code</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Since #13812 the p2 incoming body carries <code>wasmtime_wasi_http::Error</code> rather than <code>ErrorCode</code>, so the stream error handed to the guest wraps an <code>Error</code> and <code>http-error-code</code> downcasting it to <code>ErrorCode</code> always returned <code>none</code>.</p>\n<p>Convert a wrapped <code>Error</code> through the p2 hooks instead. The error is borrowed from the resource table while the hooks take <code>&amp;mut self</code>, so <code>error_to_p2</code> now takes <code>&amp;Error</code> and lives on <code>dyn WasiHttpHooks</code>. While here, also unwrap a nested <code>Error</code> in the hyper source chain as <code>error_to_p3</code> already does.</p>\n</blockquote>",
